selection.rule:
, on val_select only (written to runs/bench_v1/pipeline_selection.json before any T-set number is
read; the rule is fixed before any pipeline result):
  1. counts of the three seeds are pooled per lineage group (seed-averaged metrics);
  2. eligible = every val_select source meets its acceptance.yaml precision target (ACNE-DET, ACNE04: T1 targets;
     DetectDataSkin-2: T2) for location precision and for tier A / tier B precision where the tier is shown;
     no eligible pipeline -> all are ranked and the report says no pipeline met every target;
  3. criteria in order: mean per-source location recall, mean per-source coverage A+B on found, correct labels (A
     right type + B right group) per typed photo. At each step the leader is kept together with every pipeline whose
     paired bootstrap difference to it (1000 resamples of lineage groups, 95 %) contains 0; one left -> chosen;
     still tied after the last criterion -> the leader of the last criterion.
